  (text "CAN A / B — independent development power branches"
    (at 25.4 15.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "bcee4301-b646-4d19-bc74-1e6f66c6ccd7")
  )
  (text "Shared essential +3V3; each TPS2553 latch-off branch feeds only its own TCAN VCC / VIO and local reservoir."
    (at 25.4 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "052214b3-9bdd-45a9-8e11-2e51c90e33fa")
  )
  (text "CAN A"
    (at 25.4 33.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "7d519dc3-43c7-485c-a52e-c96c3c9b3630")
  )
  (text "CAN B"
    (at 228.6 33.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "c6f5a90d-95b1-4e75-922e-681383eeffe0")
  )
  (text "CUSTOM — REVIEW REQUIRED\nTPS2553 construction authorized; development use"
    (at 96.52 33.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.85 0.85) (color 0 255 0 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "a8b98a7c-c8c1-4574-a17a-1bb365ff0f44")
  )
  (text "CUSTOM — REVIEW REQUIRED\nTPS2553 construction authorized; development use"
    (at 299.71999999999997 33.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.85 0.85) (color 0 255 0 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "ea43a239-1447-4f41-92d7-e01844b35a44")
  )
  (text "Control and recovery"
    (at 25.4 180.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "530947f5-582d-40f0-8caa-250edb15143a")
  )
  (text "EPS_CAN_x_STB HIGH (reset/default): inverter LOW, branch OFF.\nSTB LOW: branch enabled; wait provisionally 20 ms before bus use.\nDisabled channel cannot wake on CAN. FAULT is a bench testpoint only.\n1k TXD / RXD / STB series parts and MCU-side pulls are on CAN interfaces.\nOutput flags describe actual TPS energy through passive 1 ohm filters."
    (at 25.4 187.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "78a9261a-be8d-4ccd-99e5-b10b2710aa1d")
  )
  (text "Development limits — not system fault acceptance"
    (at 228.6 180.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "605ed8b7-abf6-404f-bfb1-4e23e6acb7bd")
  )
  (text "Conditional nominal models do not qualify arbitrary input / TPS-OUT shorts,\nPVT / thermal / fast response / healthy-channel survival or full discharge.\nRXD static high margin is about 68 mV under the stated load assumptions.\nInverter threshold guard uses adjacent supply rows, not a 3.3 V guarantee.\nNo production PCB synchronization or flight qualification."
    (at 228.6 187.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "cfd52932-e1d9-4f2a-b67c-f649eab1828d")
  )
  (text "New precision resistors: TNPW0603, 0.1%, 25 ppm/K, 0.110 W general P70.\nPost-switch 1 ohm: CRCW12061R00FKEAHP, 1%, 100 ppm/K, 0.75 W P70.\n100 nF: GRM188R72A104KA35D, X7R, 10%, 100 V, 0603."
    (at 25.4 219.71 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.85 0.85)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "bf739c7e-30fb-4ec0-acce-aae398fec767")
  )
  (text "S11 instance sourcing fields are saved; exact orientation-aware display / font\nand TPS library field anchors remain API presentation limitations.\nTI inverter uses accepted generic hand-solder lands; reserve >=4.76 x4.05 mm\nfor package flash + clearance. Mechanical / assembly acceptance remains open."
    (at 228.6 219.71 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.85 0.85)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "2fe6f751-da3e-4f89-85ec-d654378432dd")
  )
